# All of it in Russian: весь день, всё, что…
subtitle: "Весь, э́тот and тот case by case — всего́, со все́ми, обо всём, в э́том году́ — and всё, что… / все, кто… for everything that and everyone who."
tags: ["russian","весь","всё что","russian pronouns","russian grammar"]
teaches: ["grammar/determiners","vocabulary/work"]
thumb: "band \"All of it, case by case\""
voices: {"a":"gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would","b":"gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated"}
next: {"title":"Away and around in Russian: отнести, обойти, сойти","href":"https://www.drawcast.app/#gh=hmelberg/drawcast-library/russian-from-zero/133-russian-away-around.cast"}

## All of it in Russian: весь день, всё, что…
stress: new
level: basic
